# Agent Runbook Example

1. Read `AGENTS.md`.
2. Confirm the active package.
3. Read `docs/project_contract.md`, `docs/context.md`, `docs/packages.md`,
   `docs/security.md`, and `docs/runbook.md`.
4. Grill before build.
5. Use a test-first loop for behavior changes.
6. Run `make public-safety-check`, `make test`, and `make verify`.
7. Do not commit; report recommended commit commands.
